turn the vehicle to its original state. <a href=\"/full-vinyl-remove-ford-e-150/\">Click here</a> to view a full wrap removal. We have added decals to larger trucks like the Hino and Silverado 3500. The most popular truck sold in Canada last year the Ford f-150, Vinyl Wrap Toronto has wrapped quite a few. We have in the past added decals to all the major brands and truck makes.</p> <p>Speak to one of our experts at <a href=\"tel:416-746-1381\">416-746-1381</a> to get a quote for a decal on your truck. Vinyl Wrap Toronto has used the same logo that we applied to the vehicles to brand other items as well. Whether with vinyl or printed, we can brand anything with your company logo.</p> <p>If you would like to check out more truck wraps, Click <a href=\"/truck-lettering-and-decals-toronto/\">here</a>. Like us on <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/vinylwraptoronto/\">Facebook</a>, Follow us on <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/vinylwraptoronto/\">Instagram</a>, Heart us on <a href=\"https://twitter.com/vinylwraptdot\">Twitter</a> and add a Comment on <a href=\"https://www.pinterest.ca/vinylwrapstoronto/\">Pinterest</a>.</p>", "style": "text-align:start;font-family:\"Poppins\", Sans-serif;font-size:18px;line-height:1.5em;font-weight:300"}, {"type": "postnav", "prev": {"href": "/equipment-wrap-random-items-wrapped/", "text": "Prev Previous Random Items Wrapped; Equipment Wrap"}, "next": {"href": "/savannah-coolcheck-van-decals/", "text": "Next Savannah CoolCheck Van Decals – Custom Vehicle Graphics Next"}}]}, {"width": 50, "blocks": [{"type": "heading", "level": 2, "text": "Limited Time Offer", "href": null, "style": "text-align:center;font-family:\"Poppins\", Sans-serif;font-size:22px;color:#FFFFFF;font-weight:500"}, {"type": "heading", "level": 2, "text": "Get a Standard 3M or Avery Manufactured Full Wrap for a Tesla at", "href": null, "style": "text-align:center;font-family:\"Poppins\", Sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.4em;color:var( --e-global-color-a8178e9 );